---
import V4Layout from "../layouts/V4Layout.astro";
import { agents } from "../lib/agents";
import { appUrl, sourceUrl } from "../lib/site";
---
<V4Layout>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hero-float" aria-hidden="true">
      {agents.map((agent) => <span class:list={["float-mark", `float-${agent.position}`]}><span class="float-card"><img src={`/harnesses/${agent.icon}`} alt="" width="48" height="48" /></span></span>)}
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow">PROJECTS. PEOPLE. AGENTS.</p>
      <h1>项目管理，<br />与编码 Agent，<br /><span>终于在一起。</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">项目、任务、Markdown 与 Agent Chat，同一个工作台。<br class="desktop-break" />在可信本机自托管，使用你自己的模型账号。</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/get-started/">开始自托管 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="source-link" href={sourceUrl ?? '#open-source'}>为你的工作流而构建 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <p class="hero-platforms">Web 工作台 <span>·</span> 桌面应用</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="product-preview" aria-label="产品界面截图预留区域">
        <div class="preview-bar"><span class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>Dovspace</span><span>WORKSPACE</span></div>
        <div class="preview-empty"><span class="preview-monogram" aria-hidden="true">PM</span><p>你的项目，你的 Agent。</p><span class="preview-caption">产品界面截图预留</span></div>
      </figure>
      <div class="product-labels"><span>项目与任务</span><span>Agent 对话</span><span>文件与终端</span><span>代码交付</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="agents" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR AGENTS, TOGETHER</p><h2>选择 Provider，<br />在同一工作台里工作。</h2><p>界面提供多种 Provider 适配入口。<br class="desktop-break" />实际可用性取决于本机 CLI、账号、模型与对应能力验收；图标不代表合作或全部功能已验证。</p></div>
      <div class="harness-grid">
        {agents.map((agent) => <div class="harness"><img src={`/harnesses/${agent.icon}`} alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy" /><div><h3>{agent.name}</h3><p>{agent.tag}</p></div></div>)}
      </div>
      <div class="harness-footer"><span>使用自己的账号与模型</span><span>也支持 Muse Code、Pi、OMP 与 ACP Registry</span><span>按 Provider 实际能力运行</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section workflow-section">
    <div class="container split">
      <div class="workflow-visual" role="img" aria-label="使用流程示意：项目计划、Agent 会话、结果核对；不是交付工作台截图">
        <div class="workflow-head"><span class="status-dot"></span> PLAN → VERIFY <span>使用流程示意</span></div>
        <ol class="workflow-steps">
          <li><span class="step-number">01</span><div><strong>项目计划</strong><span>需求、任务与文档</span></div><span class="step-tag">Plan</span></li>
          <li><span class="step-number">02</span><div><strong>Agent 开发</strong><span>对话、文件与终端</span></div><span class="step-tag">Build</span></li>
          <li><span class="step-number">03</span><div><strong>结果核对</strong><span>原操作收据与业务状态</span></div><span class="step-tag">Verify</span></li>
        </ol>
        <div class="workflow-bottom"><span>交付留痕，人工确认。</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">LESS SWITCHING. MORE BUILDING.</p><h2>从项目计划，<br />到可核对的结果。</h2><p>把项目、任务、文档和 Agent 会话放在一起。PM 授权与 Agent 执行身份独立；Run 成功不等于任务完成。</p><ul class="checklist"><li>项目与任务，多种视图</li><li>同一执行目录的文件、Git 和终端</li><li>未知写入先核对原操作，不盲目重发</li></ul><p>任务详情的交付工作台目前隐藏；不将后端保留能力表述为已开放页面。</p><a class="text-link" href={appUrl}>进入工作台 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="open-source" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">OPEN SOURCE</p><h2>让工具，按你的方式工作。</h2><p>查看代码，调整界面，连接自己的 Agent。<br class="desktop-break" />在自己的环境里，构建自己的工作流。</p></div>
      <div class="open-grid">
        <div class="terminal tile"><div class="terminal-bar"><span class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>~/pm-agent</span></div><div class="terminal-body"><p class="terminal-comment"># 在已初始化的项目中</p><p><span class="prompt">$</span> pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</p><p><span class="prompt">$</span> pnpm dev:v4</p><p class="terminal-comment"># 修改代码，预览你的工作台。</p><p><span class="prompt">$</span> <span class="caret" aria-hidden="true"></span></p></div></div>
        <div class="open-pitch tile"><ul><li><strong>界面属于你。</strong><span>调整布局，让项目与会话更顺手。</span></li><li><strong>Agent 由你选择。</strong><span>连接自己的 Provider、模型和工具。</span></li><li><strong>运行在自己的环境。</strong><span>使用本地部署或连接自己的服务。</span></li></ul><div class="open-actions">{sourceUrl ? <a class="btn btn-primary" href={sourceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">浏览源代码 ↗</a> : <><span class="btn btn-disabled" aria-disabled="true">源码地址待补充</span><span class="small-note">公开仓库链接预留</span></>}</div></div>
      </div>
      <p class="small-note">项目自有代码采用 AGPL-3.0-only；第三方材料保留原许可。公开仓库首页不是当前运行版本或安装包的对应源码证明，具体以 commit／发行清单为准。字体、素材与正式发行门禁见 <a href="/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt">第三方说明</a>。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section final-cta"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">ONE WORKSPACE. YOUR AGENTS.</p><h2>让项目向前。<br />让结果可核对。</h2><p>先了解安全边界，再启动你自己的 Dovspace。</p><div class="cta-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/get-started/">开始自托管 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href={appUrl}>打开工作台 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</V4Layout>
